o make a  living off of this so make it easy for  yourself and make it easy for your  clients make that list go start talking  to people let them know what you're  doing let them know what you want to try  to build get some feedback see what  people have to say see what their  challenges are and there will be  opportunities that will open up that  maybe you didn't even think of that you  can start with them on there may be one  simple small little project and if you  over deliver like crazy you might be  their full-time person that they always  bring on and tell their friends about  and it'll take you in a direction that  you never even thought was possible but  you don't know that until you go out and  start talking to potential customers  believe those you watching liked the  video please give it a thumbs up below  it makes you want to do more for you and  please leave a comment under this video  I love seeing them come in and makes my  morning every day and if you have a  question leave it below I'll answer you  with the video reply thank you so much  I'll see you soon
 

